#  LWR Sample problem

title 'PWR 3x3 Sample Problem' /

square /    square problem, not hex
nrow    3    / number of rows of rods along one edge
ppitch  1.26 / rod pitch
apitch  3.98 / assembly pitch with gap .1

# Material List:  (edit to top of mesh file)
matname  1  Fuel1
matname  2  Fuel2
matname  3  Clad
matname  4  Coolant
matcool  4    / coolant material number

# define pin radii and material numbers by ring
pinrad A 0.2 0.418 0.475 /
pinrad B 0.2 0.418 0.475 /
pinrad W 0.2 0.561 0.602 / guide rod

pinmat A 1 1 3 /
pinmat B 2 2 3 /
pinmat W 4 4 3 /  water rod

# map of pin types
rodmap
  A A A
  A W A
  A B A / fuel type map

